 is a captivating musical puzzle game designed for VR, inspired by the fascinating phenomenon of \"synesthesia\" where senses blend and colors emerge from melodies.\nIn Synthesia, players hone their musical ear by solving a series of visually and aurally immersive puzzles. Listen to a captivating tune and then rearrange blocks representing sounds and shift notes up or down to match the melody.\nWhether you're a budding musician or simply enjoy a good brain-teaser, Synthesia provides a fun and educational experience for all.", "short_description": "Step into a world where you don\u2019t just hear the music\u2014you see it. Synthesia is a multisensory puzzle game that pairs colors and notes to train players' pitch recognition. Players solve fun puzzles while experiencing a VR simulation of the sensory phenomenon known as \"synesthesia\"."}]}, "developer_name": "Luxi Liu", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://luxi-liu97.github.io/synthesia_pp.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Iota Co", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://luxi-liu97.github.io/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": null, "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1672577396871977"}, {"id": "377978390272490"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH", "HAND_TRACKING"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "8572254726119882"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "840880844612955"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "840880844612955"}, "is_approved": true, "